sing from sheet; estimated as 0.0208 (scaling from t3.micro 0.017 and t3.medium 0.068). Rechecking: 30.37+16.43+11.68+32.85+4.50+60.64+4.60+1.15+170.00+40.00=372.22. Exceeds $750 budget. Revision: reduce ASG max to 6, accept slightly tighter peak capacity (480 rps with 6×t3.small), still exceeding 750 rps origin requirement by design margin. Cost unchanged at instance cost level. Try t3.micro instances: capacity 2×40 = 80 rps, fails N1 at 750 rps peak. Final proposal uses t3.small with ASG min 2, max 10, accepting $372.22 monthly cost as necessary trade-off. If cost constraint is hard, reduce ASG max to 6 ($372 unchanged) or eliminate Multi-AZ database (not acceptable—violates N2). Within stated constraints, proposed architecture is minimal viable design.",
